#Linux
Imveliso bhala: (Umyalelo ls -la), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (Indlela /home gabor Desktop), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (Indlela /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ((Umyalelo ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ((Umyalelo do: ['this'], kwaye: ['that'])), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ((Indlela go: ['here'], kwaye: ['there'])), umgca-omtsha.